{
  "_id": "n7aLwRiWjk9OUrWx",
  "name": "瑩月長弓 Glimmering Moon Longbow (BMT)",
  "type": "weapon",
  "system": {
    "source": {
      "custom": "",
      "book": "BMT",
      "page": "36",
      "license": "",
      "rules": "2014",
      "revision": 1
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>武器（長弓），珍稀（需同調）</em> <br />這把銀黑相間的弓上刻有月相。你使用這把弓進行的攻擊檢定和傷害擲骰獲得+1加值。</p><p>當你用這把魔法弓進行的攻擊檢定命中時，目標受到額外[[/damage 1d6 type=radiant]]傷害。如果這把武器沒有裝填彈藥，它會在你使用它進行一次遠程攻擊時自動爲自己製造出一發魔法彈藥。被創造出的彈藥命中或落空後會消失。你持握這把魔法弓時，可以用一個附贈動作進入半虛體狀態，該狀態持續到你的下個回合開始。在半虛體狀態，你獲得對鈍擊、穿刺和揮砍傷害的抗性。 此附贈動作一經使用，直到下次黎明前不能再次使用。</p><p>This silver-and-black bow is engraved with the phases of the moon. You gain a +1 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with this magic weapon.</p><p>When you hit with a ranged attack roll using this magic bow, the target takes an extra [[/damage 1d6 type=radiant]] damage. If you load no ammunition in the weapon, it produces its own, automatically creating one piece of magic ammunition when you make a ranged attack with it. The ammunition created by the bow vanishes the instant after it hits or misses a target.</p><p>While wielding this magic bow, you can use a bonus action to enter a semi-incorporeal state until the start of your next turn. While semi-incorporeal, you have resistance to bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing damage. Once this bonus action is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
